{"name":"Partridge","hex":"#844c44","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Partridge","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A surname.","A minor city in Reno County, Kansas, United States, named after the bird."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Partridge"}],"entries":[{"title":"Partridge","blocks":[{"text":"A partridge is a medium-sized galliform bird in any of several genera, with a wide native distribution throughout parts of Europe, Asia and Africa. Several species have been introduced to the Americas. They are sometimes grouped in the Perdicinae subfamily of the Phasianidae. However, molecular research suggests that partridges are not a distinct taxon within the superfamily Phasianoidea, but that some species are closer to the pheasants, while others are closer to the junglefowl."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/CRESTED_WOOD-PARTRIDGE_%287181284331%29.jpg/330px-CRESTED_WOOD-PARTRIDGE_%287181284331%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Partridge","wikidata":"Q732775"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Birds_of_Hindustan_luchas%2C_called_b%C5%ABqalam%C5%ABn%2C_and_partridges.jpg/500px-Birds_of_Hindustan_luchas%2C_called_b%C5%ABqalam%C5%ABn%2C_and_partridges.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Birds_of_Hindustan_luchas%2C_called_b%C5%ABqalam%C5%ABn%2C_and_partridges.jpg/500px-Birds_of_Hindustan_luchas%2C_called_b%C5%ABqalam%C5%ABn%2C_and_partridges.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Birds of Persia luchas, called būqalamūn (بوقلمون turkey in Persian), and partridges","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABirds_of_Hindustan_luchas%2C_called_b%C5%ABqalam%C5%ABn%2C_and_partridges.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb